WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.041 --> 00:00:02.583
-Welcome to the arena outside of space and time.

00:00:02.583 --> 00:00:07.666
We have 2001 Allen Iverson fresh off his 
last chance to win a championship.

00:00:07.666 --> 00:00:11.375
-Versus Kyrie Irving, who still 
hasn't imploded the Nets.

00:00:11.375 --> 00:00:15.666
-But if we have the power of time control, why are 
we using it for basketball debates?

00:00:15.666 --> 00:00:19.541
-Iverson does his crossover yet again.

00:00:22.375 --> 00:00:25.041
-Aight, bro, we get it. I'm a huge influence on you.

00:00:25.583 --> 00:00:26.958
-Kyrie scores!

